Description: A Shiny application that allows to perform biostatistical
    analyses without any programming knowledge. It provides univariate
    descriptive analyses of quantitative and qualitative variables, crossed
    tables with automatic statistical test selection, survival analysis,
    diagnostic test performances (ROC curves) and concordance analysis
    (Cohen's kappa). The application was designed for medical education and
    is developed by the 'Groupe Méthode en Recherche Clinique' (GMRC) of the
    Hôpitaux Universitaires de Strasbourg.
